/-!
# Iwasawa and Cartan decompositions of GL₂ (M1 U3: non-archimedean local field; M2 U1: ℝ)

Lean counterpart of `vol1/ch-0-05-decompositions.tex` (§ "Iwasawa decomposition", local and real items; § "Cartan
decomposition"). Owner: L2 (M1), L1 (M2).

Conventions: `K_F` is `𝐊[F]` (Conventions); double cosets are Mathlib's `DoubleCoset.doubleCoset g K K`
(`= K * {g} * K`); left cosets `gK` are elements of `GL (Fin 2) F ⧸ 𝐊[F]`. Exponents of the Cartan elements are
integers, with `a ≥ b` (D-CARTAN).
